            <profile name="Master of the Battlefield" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait" hidden="false" id="13d9-9cd5-7bdd-d826">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">As Warlord, Ireton MaSade automatically has this trait and no other.
• After both sides have deployed (including Infiltrators and Scouts) and any roll to Seize the Initiative, but before the game begins, the Controlling Player may redeploy up to three of their units within the mission's limits. They may go into Reserves but not into a Deep Strike, Subterranean or Flanking Assault. Each Tercio unit counts separately and may ignore the normal Tercio deployment rules when redeployed.
• Before deployment, the Controlling Player picks one phase. While MaSade lives, the army gains one extra Reaction in that phase of the opponent's turn.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
